Hmm key={current} on incoming: when current changes, new element remounts. When previous is cleared, the incoming layer key stays same → no remount. Good.

Issue: previous key `out-${previous}` when scrolling backwards from 1→0, previous=1 but current=0; keys distinct. Good.

