Add `const resetTimer = useRef(0);` — but effect cleanup. Also `move` should clearTimeout resetTimer.

Note: when leaving, `is-tilting` removed → `.tilt::after` opacity 0 over 0.3s while --mx retains → glow fades in place. 

One more subtlety: leaving removes --rx/--ry so tilt rotates back while highlight fades — fine.

